?\n\nFixes the half-float paths of `Image.linear_to_srgb()` and `srgb_to_linear()` added in #119093:\n\n- RGBAH results were written to the wrong pixel (`p_i` instead of `i`), so Movie Maker with HDR 2D and a transparent background wrote dark frames.\n- Mipmaps weren't converted.\n- If the image data was shared with another `Vector`, the threads copied it at the same time, losing rows or crashing.\n\n## Additional information\n\nAdded a test for RGBH and RGBAH that crashes on master and passes with this. No change in speed on an 8K image.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124545/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124545/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}